{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45310","headline":"灵澈上人何山寺七贤石诗 · 皎然","name":"灵澈上人何山寺七贤石诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七石配七贤，隐僧山上移。\n石性殊磊落，君子又高奇。\n跂禅服宜坏，坐客冠可隳。\n夜倚月树影，昼倾风竹枝。\n集质患追琢，表顽用磷缁。\n佚火玉亦害，块然长在兹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}